 steps:['A lysosomal enzyme is made on rough ER','It travels to the cis-Golgi in a COPII vesicle','A phosphotransferase adds a phosphate tag to its mannose','The mannose-6-phosphate tag is exposed','Receptors in the trans-Golgi bind the tag','Clathrin-coated vesicles carry the enzyme to the lysosome'],
